{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "041I", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-conventions}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d9768096162f1cfefa4c1b70ed94bb548070b59bba6223ed161c682fecd91c3b", "source_text": "Conventions", "source_text_hash": "sha256:67403311ddbf1da257dde7fb9342946e93760ace7572de33c61316cd8cdb4873", "unit_id": "tag:041I:title"}
{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "041I", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0002": "$A$", "MATH_0003": "$\\Spec(A)$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$X$", "MATH_0006": "$S$", "MATH_0007": "$X \\times_S X$", "MATH_0008": "$X$", "MATH_0009": "$S$", "MATH_0010": "$X \\times X$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0002": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0003": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:108d24f7179abc7749f1d6fc876f92e61b48a998c454aeb1cbf4b480e44a2b8e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:584b3d3a407c5d55c15f6cdc1d9ef16c552ef50d1c29eaecd113b2dd58923935", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe standing assumption is that all schemes are contained in\na big fppf site <MATH_0001>. And all rings <MATH_0002> considered\nhave the property that <MATH_0003> is (isomorphic) to an\nobject of this big site.\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nLet <MATH_0004> be a scheme and let <MATH_0005> be an algebraic space over <MATH_0006>.\nIn this chapter and the following we will write <MATH_0007>\nfor the product of <MATH_0008> with itself (in the category of algebraic\nspaces over <MATH_0009>), instead of <MATH_0010>.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:47e4e435314f8c191884a1d5f8a9a2dc56b30057dac2e1a902b0533522f93a15", "unit_id": "tag:041I:prose-0001"}
